WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.805
- [Mark] All right. Adrian.

00:00:06.805 --> 00:00:07.638
- Hey.

00:00:07.638 --> 00:00:08.877
- [Mark] Adrian, where did you grow up?

00:00:08.877 --> 00:00:09.864
Where are you from originally?

00:00:09.864 --> 00:00:11.070
- Uh, I was born in East LA, grew up in

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.943
the City of Commerce.
Went to Bollards High.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.440
Got into some trouble
in my senior year and I

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.003
finished off in Montabello.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:25.530
Got a full-ride to Cal
State LA. I was a poulterer,

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.010
and I ...

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.910
just drugs and alcohol. Yeah.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:32.752
- [Mark] What age were
you when you first got ...

00:00:32.752 --> 00:00:33.585
- I'm sorry?

00:00:33.585 --> 00:00:35.095
- [Mark] What age were
you when you first got

00:00:35.095 --> 00:00:36.405
involved with drugs?

00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:38.191
- When I first got ... when I first drank,

00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:40.190
I was nine years old. And when
I first started smoking pot,

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:42.185
I was about 15.

00:00:42.185 --> 00:00:43.018
- [Mark] Wow.

00:00:43.018 --> 00:00:46.323
- Yeah. And then after
that, it just kind of

00:00:46.323 --> 00:00:48.093
just lead to more and more.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:49.873
- [Mark] And tell me about your family.

00:00:49.873 --> 00:00:51.760
You grew up with two parents?

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.593
- No.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.573
My mom. I grew up with my
mom. A very strong woman.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:02.643
Middle ... I was the middle child. She ...

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.930
My eldest brother was the golden boy

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:10.310
and my younger son was
autistic; so I bore the brunt

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:13.720
