00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:18.720
And she was an alcoholic
as well, and she would ...

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:21.193
she would beat me.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:27.635
And she would ... she
would sexually abuse me.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.263
And when ...

00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:32.253
- [Mark] How old were you?

00:01:32.253 --> 00:01:36.440
- When she'd do that? I
didn't stop sleeping in the

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.860
same bed with her until I was 12.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.087
- [Mark] Oh, wow.

00:01:40.087 --> 00:01:42.870
- And I ... and that's when
I went to go stay with my

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:47.053
brother in Spain. He was in
the Air Force, and then his ...

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:52.070
his wife seduced me, and I

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.263
got ... and that happened.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:06.890
It's ... it's been pretty
much no stability in

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.913
my entire life. I ...

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:14.050
it just didn't pan out.
I ... I was a cutter.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:17.533
I ... I just stopped
cutting last year. But,

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:23.873
that was another way to deal
with ... with everything.

00:02:26.497 --> 00:02:27.930
And yeah. It just ...

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.307
you know, I've been married
four times; all abusive women.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.643
I have two boys.

00:02:39.914 --> 00:02:42.200
My older son's 29;

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.670
and my younger son is 26.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.850
My older son's an animator.
He works for the Studios

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.590
in Burbank. He does his runs.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:54.900
And my younger son is a
chef. For the life of me,

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.680
I can't remember the
name of the restaurant,

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.570
but it's here in Downtown LA.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:02:59.810
- [Mark] So you're kids are great.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:03.760
- Yes. I was completely
transparent with them from

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:08.507
the get-go. And I pretty much said, if ...

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:13.720
my older son ... I groomed
him to be an animator.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.760
I mean, I ... I always wanted
to be one, but I couldn't

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.300
